    "segments": [
      {
        "role": "sara",
        "speaker": "Sara",
        "sourceStart": 6,
        "sourceEnd": 65,
        "text": "Are you ready for our school's environment event next week?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "aa7f4a9920504a84c93e5c623aaca3a1e1280caeb8d847e3d68968fc7085d62d",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0
      },
      {
        "role": "jon",
        "speaker": "Jon",
        "sourceStart": 71,
        "sourceEnd": 193,
        "text": "Almost. It is on Thursday at two, and the hall is booked. I want visitors to understand how we can reduce waste at school.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "bcb6bc387fe4c36adfc56c8494a190919ed8bfdeaf607c15bf58fd115e7d68b4",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.85
      },
      {
        "role": "sara",
        "speaker": "Sara",
        "sourceStart": 200,
        "sourceEnd": 349,
        "text": "I have made a sign about litter near the river. After lunch, paper and plastic are often left beside the path. We need to protect the wildlife there.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "495815875aa7d3838a1d85455a0f0d23e6f7c6183a1c7cfc927ed89822bb64de",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.85
      },
      {
        "role": "jon",
        "speaker": "Jon",
        "sourceStart": 355,
        "sourceEnd": 484,
        "text": "Good. We should explain that litter can harm a bird's habitat. I will ask the nature club to show a picture of one local species.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "da10e85c2d2fdf47be83cc41ec786b653abfc48e83f113ba7746d0670b450d43",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.85
      },
      {
        "role": "sara",
        "speaker": "Sara",
        "sourceStart": 491,
        "sourceEnd": 606,
        "text": "Shall we call the activity a cleanup? I have gloves for twelve students, and the rubbish will be collected in bags.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "cf9480ec2a2223d97767837440eeeda19ab1be541c93cfdc609de8344131cf03",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.85
      },
      {
        "role": "jon",
        "speaker": "Jon",
        "sourceStart": 612,
        "sourceEnd": 725,
        "text": "Yes, but first we will check the path with a teacher. The cleanup will start at three, after the hall discussion.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "00c8bdd0d1351eae3045461a74f814bd562d884dede2b12fb585412aa9ce641b",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.85
      },
      {
        "role": "sara",
        "speaker": "Sara",
        "sourceStart": 732,
        "sourceEnd": 869,
        "text": "I also have a box for clean metal cans. In our school's program, those cans are accepted for recycling. Can we recycle plastic there too?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "c412dca9016e1bfbc6a4d167b45ae47f2677a9f7baceefbd94a1098804c89ff5",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.85
      },
      {
        "role": "jon",
        "speaker": "Jon",
        "sourceStart": 875,
        "sourceEnd": 1020,
        "text": "Only the bottles listed on the school notice. We should read the notice before we put anything in the box. Other garbage goes in the regular bin.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "19c1bcb35abe4e67da1b1dbd70e4d5513b916a412838114302e617d8e4b28091",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.85
      },
      {
        "role": "sara",
        "speaker": "Sara",
        "sourceStart": 1027,
        "sourceEnd": 1123,
        "text": "What about the old wood from the garden signs? Could we reuse it instead of buying new material?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "47ab363772cc022b9b89e076ada4d5e655a82000169a24f3763809ed35775095",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.85
      },
      {
        "role": "jon",
        "speaker": "Jon",
        "sourceStart": 1129,
        "sourceEnd": 1259,
        "text": "Yes. It is kept in the storage room, and the art group will turn it into new signs. That is one sustainable choice we can explain.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "56344e6d2d28b627109a78f9c70ec97e0c7c3c421912b049a45b4bbccca636a7",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.85
      },
      {
        "role": "sara",
        "speaker": "Sara",
        "sourceStart": 1266,
        "sourceEnd": 1385,
        "text": "I want to add a display about renewable energy. The science class has a small model that uses sunlight to power a lamp.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "cd6c9567ab044c7771bb9f6d660d73d46548cfcbe000be3389e2dc5b27da7506",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.85
      },
      {
        "role": "jon",
        "speaker": "Jon",
        "sourceStart": 1391,
        "sourceEnd": 1534,
        "text": "Bring it, please. We can put it beside the map of the lake and the ocean. The geography teacher is drawing arrows to show where the water goes.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "9fbb439c34b4ed78ca80e80bfe5094c6b8a566146a2a9bf1a3a7b6bb419e118c",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.85
      },
      {
        "role": "sara",
        "speaker": "Sara",
        "sourceStart": 1541,
        "sourceEnd": 1665,
        "text": "I will make a second card about ecology and conservation, too. It can ask visitors how their choices affect a natural place.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "12119fda2c6a82cf4914c58c3ecb8cad0ea7eb66989802a72d84be874bb584b4",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.85
      },
      {
        "role": "jon",
        "speaker": "Jon",
        "sourceStart": 1671,
        "sourceEnd": 1772,
        "text": "Great. After the event, the ideas are read by the club, and we choose one to try the following month.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "d68452fb9e1e3c1926347b98665c8f4d0a28e30f9df744a22d47d735d14bfbc9",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.85
      }
    ]
  },
